&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_huggingface_inference_providers&quot;&gt;HuggingFace Inference Providers&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HuggingFace doesn&amp;#8217;t perform inference itself — it aggregates third-party &lt;strong&gt;providers&lt;/strong&gt; (Novita, Together, DeepInfra, Cerebras, SambaNova, Fireworks, Groq…) via a unified API. You choose the cheapest or fastest provider. Here are the rates found in May 2026 for DeepSeek V4 Pro:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
