&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_option_1_the_isolated_plugin_no_dogfooding&quot;&gt;Option 1: The Isolated Plugin (no dogfooding)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_option_2_the_classic_monorepo_includeplugin&quot;&gt;Option 2: The Classic Monorepo (&lt;code&gt;include(&quot;:plugin&quot;)&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_option_3_the_composite_build_includebuild&quot;&gt;Option 3: The Composite Build (&lt;code&gt;includeBuild()&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_the_solution_two_independent_builds_one_consumer_root&quot;&gt;The Solution: Two Independent Builds, One Consumer Root&lt;/a&gt;
