&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_possible_additions&quot;&gt;Possible Additions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_sequence_diagram_kitty_initialization_with_transparency&quot;&gt;Sequence Diagram - Kitty Initialization with Transparency&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
