&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_the_problem_thinking_freely_without_publishing_just_anything&quot;&gt;The Problem: Thinking Freely without Publishing Just Anything&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_the_stimulus_pattern_born_fixed_diluted_died&quot;&gt;The STIMULUS Pattern — Born, Fixed, Diluted, Died&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_delegation_to_the_llm_why_the_llm_is_the_one_filtering&quot;&gt;Delegation to the LLM: Why the LLM is the one Filtering&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
