&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://zsh.sourceforge.io/Doc/Release/Files.html&quot;&gt;Zsh documentation: Startup Files&lt;/a&gt;— The official reference on Zsh initialization files. This is where everything is explained, even if we often forget.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
