&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_pitfall_2_uninitialized_logger&quot;&gt;❌ Pitfall #2: Uninitialized Logger&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_pitfall_3_excessive_logging&quot;&gt;❌ Pitfall #3: Excessive Logging&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
