&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Toolz is a Python library for functional programming that provides tools for working with pure functions and iterables.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
