&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;async/await simplifies promise management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Example of rating:&lt;/p&gt;
