&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_analyze_and_gather_requirements&quot;&gt;Analyze and gather requirements&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
