&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_scope_the_project_with_your_team&quot;&gt;Scope the project with your team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;../../img/conductor.png&quot; alt=&quot;conductor&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
